.
.  Plot for F CDF table
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na fpdftb.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE OFFSET 3
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE F PDF (One-Sided Test at Alpha = 0.05)
TITLE SIZE 5
LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
SET X11 HARDWARE FILL OFF
REGION FILL OFF ON ON
REGION BASE 0 ALL
.
PLOT FPDF(X,10,10) FOR X = 0 0.01 6 AND
. PLOT FPDF(X,10,10) FOR X = 0 0.01 0.27 AND
. PLOT FPDF(X,10,10) FOR X = 3.72 0.01 6
PLOT FPDF(X,10,10) FOR X = 2.98 0.01 6
.
font simplex
height 3
movedata 4.0 0.05
text lc()alph() = 0.05 (2.98)
. movedata 0.35 0.05
. text lc()alph() = 0.025
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp FPDFTB.PS fpdftb.ps
system rm FPDFTB.PS
.
quit
